# Travel Hacking Toolkit - API keys (ALL OPTIONAL)
#
# FREE-FIRST: every core capability works with ZERO keys.
# Copy this file to .env and fill in only the upgrades you want.
# Cash flight search, hotel/ferry/Airbnb search, and cached award
# availability for ~the next 60 days all work with nothing set here.

# === AWARD FLIGHTS ===
# seats.aero Pro - unlocks LIVE award search, dates beyond ~60 days, and alerts.
# Without it, cached award search for the next ~60 days still works (keyless MCP).
# Get a Pro account at https://seats.aero
SEATS_AERO_API_KEY=

# === CASH FLIGHTS ===
# Duffel - cleaner per-fare-class GDS cash pricing. Search is free.
# Without it, Skiplagged + Kiwi (keyless) still return cash fares.
# Sign up at https://duffel.com
DUFFEL_API_KEY=

# === LOYALTY BALANCES ===
# AwardWallet - auto-pull your balances and elite status.
# Without it, just tell the agent your balances once.
# Business account: https://business.awardwallet.com/profile/api
AWARDWALLET_API_KEY=
AWARDWALLET_USER_ID=

# === HOTELS ===
# LiteAPI - live hotel rates and booking.
# Without it, Trivago + Airbnb (keyless) still cover hotel discovery.
# Sign up at https://liteapi.travel
LITEAPI_API_KEY=
